# Daisy Logging Post-Hook

Log what you do for the user with `daisy log`, as rule 6 of the Daisy prompt (`prompts/daisy.md` in the Daisy root that `.daisy/AGENTS.md` names) says. Read that rule and its Logging Work section before your first log of the session: they say when and how (HHMM timestamps, chronological order), and its rule 10 how to name people (`~alias`).
